    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n97134" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στρᾰτί̆ωτ-ις</span></b>  (properisp.), <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ιδος</span>, fem. of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στρατιώτης</span>;
